  "support": "Two non-joining limestone blocks, presumably from the upper part (architrave) of a monumental structure, each bearing monumental letters on one face. Block 'a' is broken on the right side, with the front left edge of the face also missing and some damage to the upper edge. The block is H 54.5 cm x W 68 cm (73 at rear) x D 63 cm. Block 'b' is intact on the top, but partially damaged below and with some damage / loss to the left and right ends. H 53.5 cm x  W 109 cm x D 58.5 cm.",
  "objectType": {
    "_": "architrave",
