  "provenanceFound": {
    "_": "Found during excavations by Carettoni, summer 1956 in two separate locations to the east of the agora/'muro a bugnato'. Block 'a' found during excavations by Carettoni in trench VI (1956) on the east side of the monumental 'muro a bugnato', thought to form the foundation of a ‘portico orientale’ which borders the east side of the so-called ‘agora inferiore’. Block 'b' found during excavations by Carettoni in trench XXXII (16 October 1956) on the 'rampa settentrionale' leading from the house with portico (the so-called ginnasio) towards the monumental wall supporting the 'portico orientale'",
    "type": "found",
    "subtype": "discovered",
    "when": "1956",
